aragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Characters</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Routine Meets Fear</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shifting Reality</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy <strong>cozy games</strong> with simple mechanics but also love the <strong>slow-burn tension of psychological horror</strong>, <i>The Ice Cream Parlor</i> blends both worlds.<br>It\u2019s about serving scoops, chatting with customers, and keeping the shop tidy\u2014while questioning your own reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, the night is peaceful.<br>Sometimes, it isn\u2019t.</p>","developers":["odwar"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064960/71e40fa344b3d89816afc9ec59812df0ae39fad9/header.jpg?t=1769264948","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4064960/1285887568/7e858a193b03797c17e4138bc61a83cb6867a62a/1758872289/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759202393","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4064960/1285887568/7e858a193b03797c17e4138bc61a83cb6867a62a/1758872289/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759202393","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4064960/1285887568/7e858a193b03797c17e4138bc61a83cb6867a62a/1758872289/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759202393","id":257206692,"name":"trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257206692/de79129d415abc31c7e6db35d494a92a4407d249/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759202393"}],"name":"The Ice Cream Shop"