eam/apps/4064960/aeb2eeea5cc5ff4bb78443d8762c4fe7c210c1f8/ss_aeb2eeea5cc5ff4bb78443d8762c4fe7c210c1f8.600x338.jpg?t=1769264948"}],"short_description":"You run a late-night ice cream shop, but your illness makes reality twist. Serve customers who may not be what they seem, and try to separate your mind\u2019s visions from the horrors at your door.","steam_appid":4064960,"support_info":{"email":"gamevivaofficial@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}